      "type": "flow",
      "duration_s": 8,
      "narration": [
        "The model is the brain: it reasons, and decides what to do.",
        "Alone, it can only answer. It can't run code, call tools, or remember earlier work.",
        "The harness is the body around it: it acts, keeps memory, and enforces rules."
      ],
