    {
      "id": "parts",
      "type": "checklist",
      "duration_s": 10,
      "narration": [
        "The post lists eight building blocks a harness needs. They do four jobs.",
        "Instructions: a standing prompt with its rules, and the tools it may use.",
        "A safe place to act: an isolated sandbox.",
        "Memory: files that last between sessions, and old context summarized.",
        "Checks: tests after each action, approval before risky steps, and logs."
      ],
      "data": {
        "title": "Eight building blocks, four jobs",
        "rows": [
          {
            "label": "Tell it what to do",
            "tag": "system prompt \u00b7 tools"
          },
          {
            "label": "Give it a safe place to act",
            "tag": "sandbox"
          },
          {
            "label": "Let it remember",
            "tag": "files \u00b7 context compaction"
          },
          {
            "label": "Check its work",
            "tag": "tests \u00b7 guardrails \u00b7 observability"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "failures",
      "type": "metrics",
      "duration_s": 8,
      "narration": [
        "Most operational failures come from the harness, not the model.",
        "As history grows, the model's reasoning gets worse. That's context rot.",
        "Hand it too many tools, and it gets confused before it starts.",
        "Chain many tool calls, and a reply can take ten seconds or longer."
      ],
      "data": {
